OL,3,GNEWSAWomen urged to report sexual
OL,4,Aharassment locations
OL,5,
OL,6,FWomen and girls in south London who
OL,7,Fexperience sexual harassment are being
OL,8,Fencouraged to report the incidents in
OL,9,Forder to map where they happen.
OL,11,FMarina Ahmad, London Labour Assembly
OL,12,FMember for Lambeth and Southwark, has
OL,13,Flaunched an online reporting tool for
OL,14,Fthe two boroughs.
OL,16,FAnalysis of Met Police data by City
OL,17,FHall Labour, found last year the force
OL,18,Frecorded 2,385 sexual offences and
OL,19,F4,541 harassment offences - which
OL,20,Fequated to one sexual offence every
OL,21,Ffour hours and one of harassment every
OL,22,Ftwo hours.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
